sin an walk in shower unit.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.24m x 5.25m\nLarge double bedroom with hardwood floor and built in wardrobes.\n\nEn suite - 1.92m x 2.00m\nWith hardwood floor, panelling, walk in shower unit, wash hand basin and w.c.\n\nBathroom - 3.11m x 3.07m\nWith tiled floor, walk in shower unit, jacuzzi bath, wash hand basin and w.c.\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.39m x 3.92m\nWith hardwood floor and built in shelving.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.08m x 3.14m\nWith carpet floor.\n\n"
